---
---
<section class="py-16 bg-white" style="padding: 80px 0;">
  <div class="container mx-auto" style="max-width: 1000px;">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-4" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.25rem;">Servicii extra pentru petreceri copii</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-secondary" style="line-height: 1.6;">La cerere, programul poate fi completat cu atracții suplimentare pentru a transforma evenimentul într-o experiență completă. Explorați portofoliul nostru:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
      
      <a href="/decoratiuni-baloane-bucuresti/" class="block p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-all border border-gray-100" style="text-decoration: none; background: #f7fafc; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #edf2f7; color: inherit;">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-primary" style="color: var(--primary);">Decorațiuni din Baloane</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Arcade organice, heliu, panouri foto pentru petreceri și botezuri.</p>
        <span style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9rem;">Vezi detalii decor →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/magician-petreceri-copii/" class="block p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-all border border-gray-100" style="text-decoration: none; background: #f7fafc; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #edf2f7; color: inherit;">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-primary" style="color: var(--primary);">Magician</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Spectacol interactiv cu trucuri și iluzii pentru copii.</p>
        <span style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9rem;">Vezi detalii magician →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/vata-de-zahar-popcorn-evenimente/" class="block p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl hover:shadow-md transition-all border border-gray-100" style="text-decoration: none; background: #f7fafc; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #edf2f7; color: inherit;">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-primary" style="color: var(--primary);">Food Stations</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary text-sm mb-4" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Închiriere mașină de vată de zahăr sau popcorn pentru evenimente.</p>
        <span style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.9rem;">Vezi detalii food stations →</span>
      </a>

    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center mt-12" style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <a href="/servicii/" class="font-bold text-accent hover:underline" style="color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.1rem; text-decoration: underline;">Descoperă toate serviciile AnimaParty</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
